WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.853 --> 00:00:16.494
went with the candlemaker to see the landowner.

2
00:00:22.036 --> 00:00:22.877
here to pay my debt."

3
00:00:23.677 --> 00:00:26.938
The candlemaker gave the landowner a sack of rice.

4
00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:30.820
The landowner stroked his beard.

5
00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:33.476
"Where's the interest?"

6
00:00:37.298 --> 00:00:38.958
you think the interest is too high?"

7
00:00:39.298 --> 00:00:40.198
Gildong said.

8
00:00:42.619 --> 00:00:44.459
The landowner crossed his arms.

9
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.000
"That man agreed to pay.

10
00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.841
If he can't, he will become my servant.

11
00:00:51.941 --> 00:00:53.862
That should teach him a lesson."

12
00:00:59.363 --> 00:01:00.244
Gildong said.

13
00:01:00.264 --> 00:01:01.564
"I'll pay."

14
00:01:05.388 --> 00:01:06.689
He waved his fan.

15
00:01:06.709 --> 00:01:08.090
"Day one."

16
00:01:09.371 --> 00:01:11.752
The rice doubled, bursting the sack.

17
00:01:13.093 --> 00:01:15.094
The landowner's eyes went wide.

18
00:01:15.114 --> 00:01:16.995
"What's happening?"

19
00:01:17.015 --> 00:01:19.617
"I'm paying the interest."

20
00:01:20.938 --> 00:01:22.939
Gildong kept waving the fan.

21
00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:26.801
The rice doubled and doubled.

22
00:01:27.302 --> 00:01:29.283
"Day 15.

23
00:01:29.803 --> 00:01:30.223
Day 16."

24
00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.369
Rice rose up to the landowner's nose.

25
00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.431
The room creaked as it filled with rice.

26
00:01:39.451 --> 00:01:41.472
"Day 19."

27
00:01:45.974 --> 00:01:47.975
Okay!" the landowner said.

28
00:01:47.995 --> 00:01:49.855
"The debt is paid.

29
00:01:50.596 --> 00:01:52.997
Stop, before you destroy my house!"

30
00:01:55.058 --> 00:01:56.358
"That should teach you a lesson."

31
00:01:57.158 --> 00:02:00.520
Gildong folded the fan, and the rice disappeared.

32
00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.482
One sack sat in front of the landowner.

33
00:02:07.703 --> 00:02:09.164
Gildong glared at him.

34
00:02:09.184 --> 00:02:13.807
"If I ever hear about your cruel loans again, I'll be back."

35
00:02:19.711 --> 00:02:21.912
Gildong was quiet all afternoon.

36
00:02:22.973 --> 00:02:26.415
He was sad that so many people were poor and hungry.

37
00:02:28.156 --> 00:02:31.559
He was sad that landowners gave out unfair loans.

38
00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.009
"What's wrong, little lord?"

39
00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:38.230
Nabi asked.

40
00:02:40.071 --> 00:02:43.132
"I'm glad we helped the people in town," Gildong said.

41
00:02:43.152 --> 00:02:45.334
"But I wish we could do more."

42
00:02:47.155 --> 00:02:48.796
Mok slapped him on the back.

43
00:02:48.816 --> 00:02:50.797
"You're smart, boss.

44
00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:54.939
Maybe you can think of something."

45
00:03:00.302 --> 00:03:02.764
Soon Gildong knew just what to do.

46
00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:11.421
He gathered everyone to announce his plan.

47
00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:15.582
"Many people in this kingdom need help," he said.

48
00:03:15.602 --> 00:03:19.883
"So from now on, we won't just steal for ourselves.

49
00:03:21.364 --> 00:03:23.064
We'll give what we steal to poor people.

50
00:03:24.684 --> 00:03:27.425
And we'll only steal from greedy nobles and officials."

51
00:03:29.286 --> 00:03:30.666
The bandits cheered.

52
00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:37.248
group needs a name," Chibong said.

53
00:03:38.604 --> 00:03:40.105
Mok scratched his head.

54
00:03:40.125 --> 00:03:43.207
"What can we call a group that helps the poor?"

55
00:03:45.469 --> 00:03:46.770
Gildong smiled.

56
00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.951
"The Hwalbindang!"

57
00:03:50.592 --> 00:03:52.654
"Hooray for the Hwalbindang!"

58
00:03:53.214 --> 00:03:54.255
everyone cried.

59
00:03:55.496 --> 00:03:56.596
"What should we do first?"

60
00:03:57.057 --> 00:03:57.877
Mok asked.

61
00:03:57.897 --> 00:04:03.341
"I heard that farmers in Hamheung are starving," Chibong said.

62
00:04:03.361 --> 00:04:07.324
"The governor takes all their grain as tax.

63
00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.523
If they don't have grain, he takes whatever else they have."

64
00:04:13.344 --> 00:04:14.385
"That's horrible!"

65
00:04:14.846 --> 00:04:15.646
Nabi said.

66
00:04:15.666 --> 00:04:19.950
"The government storehouse must be so full," Gildong said.

67
00:04:21.631 --> 00:04:22.632
Mok grinned.

68
00:04:22.652 --> 00:04:24.753
"Let's rob it."

69
00:04:26.475 --> 00:04:27.816
Chibong shook his head.

70
00:04:27.836 --> 00:04:30.478
"The old royal villa is there.

71
00:04:31.359 --> 00:04:33.420
Soldiers guard the city closely."

72
00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:37.624
"Hmm," Gildong said.

73
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.304
"I know a way to distract the soldiers."
